    "detailed_description": "In a world ravaged by a megaconglomerate Oil company, Reed Shoots sure is sick of them being all evil and stuff, its time to take a stand!<br />\r\nArmed with a G.U.N. recoil blasting device, and a pair of Rocket B.O.O.T.S, Reed must hover, jump and launch through countless challenging and fast-paced levels to take down the CEO, Johnathan Oil<br />\r\nIts a tough road ahead, and your friends will only get you so far, so turn up the music, grab your G.U.N., and get to work!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Countless Kickass Levels! - Including new collectibles and Bonus levels created just for the Plus Edition!<br />\r\n-A fresh 19 song soundtrack<br />\r\n-A rich and engaging storyline - Revamped just for the Plus Edition!<br />\r\n-A giant freakin' fracking machine mecha!",
